---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' issue #2622: "skinparam padding X" enlarges the "database" symbol used
' in component/deployment diagrams. Pins the current (working) behaviour
' so a regression can be caught if this stops applying.
'
' A bare "database D" alone is ambiguous with the sequence-diagram
' "database" participant type and would silently render as a SEQUENCE
' diagram instead (a different renderer entirely: ComponentRoseDatabase,
' not the component/deployment USymbolDatabase this test targets) - the
' companion "node" plus relation forces the deployment/component reading.
skinparam padding 30
node N
database D
N --> D
@enduml
